id: pm-srns
title: "Uniform output contract: one format-flag grammar + one envelope spec across every command (JSON/TOON), old spellings alias-preserved"
description: "Define and enforce one alias-preserving output-format, envelope, and exit-code contract across all CLI commands and machine-readable surfaces."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:contracts",simplification,token-efficiency
created_at: "2026-07-11T10:47:29.123Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-04T08:45:28.306Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 600
acceptance_criteria: "Every command accepts one identical output-format flag contract; a single written envelope spec covers all read/mutation/diagnostic shapes; the per-command trap class is gone (search --format-only vs notes/validate --json-only vs activity .activity decoy); zero feature loss: all current spellings kept as deprecation-tracked aliases; contract tests assert flag+envelope parity across the full surface"
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: medium
